  "prefLabel": "En 1005.03 Index of technical standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1005.03 Index of technical standards. Each utility shall publish and maintain a complete index of all technical standards and requirements pursuant to En 1000 with references to each of the standards and requirements in a place of prominence and easy accessibility on each utility’s website.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
